OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy died by suicide after
OL,4,Atag failure - jury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Royal Marine charged with
OL,7,Fspying for Hong Kong died by suicide
OL,8,Fafter Serco failed to find his home and
OL,9,Ffit his electronic tag, a jury found.
OL,11,FMatthew Trickett, 37, had appeared in
OL,12,Fcourt charged under the National
OL,13,FSecurity Act and was found in Grenfell
OL,14,FPark, Maidenhead, on 19 May 2024.
OL,16,FAfter being arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fassisting Hong Kong's intelligence
OL,18,Fservice on 1 May, he was seen to
OL,19,Fattempt self-harm in his cell on 11
OL,20,FMay. He was released on bail two days
OL,21,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
