OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy died by suicide after
OL,4,Atag failure - jury
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrickett adhered to his bail
OL,7,Fconditions, but Serco operators "failed
OL,8,Fto take reasonable steps" to find his
OL,9,Faddress on multiple days, the jury
OL,10,Fconcluded.
